    "diagnosis": "Hydroa vacciniforme lymphoproliferative disorder",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The lesions are located in sun-exposed and non&ndash;sun-exposed areas. The skin exhibits a papulovesicular eruption. Many of the lesions are ulcerated with haemorrhagic crusts and pitted scars.",
    "source": "J. Martin Sangueza",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
