    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Hydroa vacciniforme lymphoproliferative disorder",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The lymphoid infiltrate predominates in the dermis. The infiltrate is mainly located around the adnexa and blood vessels. There is an intraepidermal spongiotic vesiculation.",
